The oracle verdict is `hardened` at the existing `medium` preset: Anthropic, Gemini, and OpenAI each returned a parsed but invalid witness; the easy rung was solved by all three. Before finalizing, I found one canonicalization subtlety worth tightening: because the witness condition is symmetric in colour/left/right coordinates, G8 should cover all six coordinate-role permutations, not only left/right swapping.
